WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:04.708
This challenge asks for patients whose admission
count is above the average admission count among

00:00:04.734 --> 00:00:12.313
patients who have at least one admission Break the
task into stages First

00:00:12.340 --> 00:00:18.065
create patient-level admission counts Then calculate
the average of those

00:00:18.079 --> 00:00:25.229
counts Finally compare each patient's count with
that average Use

00:00:25.256 --> 00:00:29.519
the starter and test the query incrementally rather
than writing everything at once
